  "plain": "James Fox, speaking on Jesse Michels's podcast, recalls what a US congressman named Schiff found in the 1990s about Roswell, the New Mexico town where many believe a craft not made by humans crashed in 1947. According to Fox, Schiff noted that all the archived government records about Roswell had been deleted. People tell this because missing records could suggest something was being hidden."
